# Experiment 3 - Few-Shot Prompting

## Prompt

```text
Country: Pakistan
Capital: Islamabad

Country: Japan
Capital: Tokyo

Country: Australia
Capital:
```

## Output

Canberra

## Observations

The AI understood the pattern from the given examples and correctly identified the capital of Australia. Providing examples before asking the question helped the AI understand the required format.

## Improvements

More examples can be added when working with difficult tasks or larger datasets. This helps the AI produce more accurate and consistent responses.

