# Experiment 4 - Structured Output (JSON)

## Prompt

```text
Return the following information only in JSON format.

Name: Ahmad
Age: 21
University: NFC IEFR
Department: Computer Science
```

## Output

```json
{
  "name": "Ahmad",
  "age": 21,
  "university": "NFC IEFR",
  "department": "Computer Science"
}
```

## Observations

The AI returned the information in a clean JSON format without adding extra text. This type of output is useful because it can easily be used in web applications, APIs, and software projects.

## Improvements

The prompt can be improved by specifying additional fields such as semester, CGPA, email, or student ID if more detailed information is required.

